1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,020
lafiya, mafi ban sha'awa da nake aiki akai a halin yanzu shine fasalin matsayin hanyar sadarwa ga masu samar da bayanai na etna data.

2
00:00:07,020 --> 00:00:09,240
zai iya bayyana kamar ƙaramin abu.

3
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:10,320
Shin wani abu ne mai ban sha'awa?

4
00:00:10,320 --> 00:00:12,060
ba a yi amfani da ita ba, a gefen baya.

5
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:15,960
yana buƙatar babban shiri da layukan lambar da yawa.

6
00:00:15,960 --> 00:00:18,300
yana da ban sha'awa musamman a gare ni saboda

7
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:19,440
wani abu da

8
00:00:19,440 --> 00:00:22,320
yana ba masu amfani damar samun dama ga halin da ake ciki.

9
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:24,000
kafin su yi kowace aiki.

10
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:29,640
A al'ada, abin da ya faru shi ne mai amfani ya bukaci ya tafi daga farko zuwa ƙarshe na bene kafin ya fara.

11
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:30,810
Hausa: huɗu

12
00:00:30,810 --> 00:00:35,430
dubawa ko saƙon kuskure yana cewa wannan mai amfani ko wannan sabis ɗin ba ya aiki.

13
00:00:35,430 --> 00:00:37,650
a halin yanzu abin da ke faruwa shi ne...

14
00:00:37,650 --> 00:00:39,330
idan mai amfani ya shiga cikin app

15
00:00:39,330 --> 00:00:40,710
don yin aiki.

16
00:00:40,710 --> 00:00:41,790
lokacin iska ko sha'awa

17
00:00:41,790 --> 00:00:44,400
za su iya ganin shi nan take a kan na'urar sadarwa ta su

18
00:00:44,400 --> 00:00:49,980
ko dai mai bayarwa yana aiki, wannan yana taimakawa wajen adana lokaci da kuma kara inganci.

19
00:00:49,980 --> 00:00:51,210
a duk r.

20
00:00:51,210 --> 00:00:54,030
sistemu

21
00:00:54,030 --> 00:00:56,470
Ina jin kamar ba ku ba ni tallafin jin dadi da nake bukata a lokacin wahala.
